        "heading_9LPUKK": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Step 3:",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "heading_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_zVDJ3M": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Air Pressure & Micro-Filtration</strong></p><ul><li>As the plunger is pressed, the increased air pressure accelerates the brewing process, reducing the acidity and bitterness associated with longer brew times.</li><li>The brew passes through a paper microfilter, removing coffee grounds, grit, and bitter oils, resulting in a smooth mouthfeel and the signature AeroPress flavour.</li><li>This air pressure allows the AeroPress to achieve a richness similar to espresso.</li></ul>",
            "enlarge_text": true
          }
        }
